-Qwen-TTS</text:p><text:p>https://habr.com/ru/articles/989244/</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="wrap" office:value-type="string"><text:p>qwen3-tts-clone</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
